{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_3_level_main_03-01_end","groupId":"main_3","stageId":"main_03-01","title":"會合","storyCode":"3-1","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_03-01_end.txt","sourceHash":"94626b87eaa02a9c1804aacea6310a5284793e64a37eddd6b920b90522b60ff4","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"整合運動的滲透令人防不勝防，眾人再次明確，首要目標是奪回米莎。\n羅德島先鋒，企鵝物流輔助，近衛局主攻，行動正式開始。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二十三关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"長官——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"整合運動的大部隊已經撤退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"陳長官，我這邊也處理完畢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——————嘖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"前些天抓住的那些整合運動嫌疑人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"刑訊科問出什麼沒有？"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_21_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動嫌疑人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這把弩，你眼熟嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動嫌疑人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你能拉得動這把弩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這個彈藥是什麼構造，怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們在貧民區做些什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你來龍門，又要做些什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動嫌疑人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那些人什麼都不說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"或者說......他們可能什麼都不知道吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就和剛剛解決的整合運動一樣，應該都是些聽話的嘍囉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——讓他們指認。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"用點方法也不要緊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"小隊資訊，領導方式，來源，戰術分佈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"有多少，讓他們說多少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"他們說多少，就給我多少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"無論有什麼新消息，立刻通知我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"明白！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"難道近衛局曾經抓捕過整合運動的成員？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"並不能確定他們的身份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"再怎麼猜測，也只是懷疑而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"聯繫星熊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"特別督查組那邊怎麼樣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"還在被一個感染者——單方面壓制嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"他們那裡的整合運動似乎也已經撤退了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局隊員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"憂心這是誘敵之計的星熊督察正在排查風險......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，一個人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"想來就來，想走就走？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"下一步的任務，你應該也很清楚了，阿米婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來，就是要奪回米莎嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"這是一次聯合作戰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"近衛局主攻，羅德島負責搜索和突襲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你們只要能拖慢整合運動的撤退進度，就算完成任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......瞭解。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"搜索敵人的話......我們可能會被發現吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，我們的偵察小隊也缺乏支援——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"光是我們可不成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"專業的事，就交給專家去做吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蘭卡，幫我聯絡企鵝物流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"又要麻煩能天使和德克薩斯他們兩個了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陳"]},{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["近衛局隊員"]},{"speakerId":"char_106_franka","aliases":["芙蘭卡"]}]}
